  "writer_text": "Colour comic panel, hand-drawn inked line art with flat cel-shaded colours, shojo manga style. Aiko dodges the blade under the rain, her coat whipping behind her, the rival lunging from the left. shojo manga, romantic style, large expressive eyes, color manga, cel shading, clean outlines, dark dramatic atmosphere, harsh lighting, strong shadows, thick bold linework, heavy inking, richly detailed background, many intricate details."
